      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This will be more entertaining when localization is implemented. From left to right the first two gaps look intentionally minimal, the third gap looks like a minimum spacing between actual clickable buttons, and the last padding is what remains.\n\nI guess they could try and even the spacing out when there is room, but I suspect there will be languages where there is no room",
