  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen looking at a world in the Main Menu, you can see the World's Thumbnail, a Join and a Drop Portal button. The distance / padding between these and the edge of the background is different however.\n\nYou can best see this when looking at my attachments below. The Join button has a similar distance to the World Thumbnail as the World Thumbnail has to the edge of the background. The distance between the Join and Drop Portal button however is bigger than that and so is the distance between the Drop Portal and the background.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nThe padding between these should be the same, e.g. my second attachment.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere are pictures showcasing the issue:",
